Subject: [PATCH] Phase 2 Step 3: Implement driver-SDDVR.s local microSD SPI0 block driver

Phase 2 Step 3 Deliverables:
- Implement driver-SDDVR.s for Olimex Agon Light 2 eZ80 SPI0 hardware block I/O
- Implement 512-byte to 256-byte sector translation (1 SD block = 2 TRSDOS sectors)
- Stream requested 256-byte sub-sector directly into user buffer with zero intermediate buffering
- Provide 8-entry sddvr_base_lba table for independent per-drive microSD .dsk image LBAs
- Intercept local SD write requests with R_PROTECTED (Error 15) write protection
- Position driver-SDDVR.s in high memory at 0xF400, lowering COREEND$ to 0xF3FF
- Connect rd_local_sd and wr_local_sd entry points in driver-FDCDVR.S
- Low driver segment (86986) expands headroom to 21 bytes below 0x001300

--- a/TRSDOS_GLOBAL/equates/equates-versions.s	2026-11-09 15:20:00
+++ b/TRSDOS_GLOBAL/equates/equates-versions.s	2026-11-09 15:20:00
@@ -36,7 +36,7 @@
 
 COREMAX$		EQU   	START$+2400h		; Start of application area when no library zone used.
 COREMIN$		EQU   	START$+3000h		; Start of application area with active library area.
-COREEND$		EQU	INTERRUPT.handler-0ch	; End+1 of usable memory for high memory routines.
+COREEND$		EQU	0F3FFh			; End of usable memory below high driver area (0F400h).
 
 ENDRAM$			EQU	10000H-1
 

--- a/TRSDOS_GLOBAL/equates/equates-global-lowcore.s	2026-11-09 15:20:00
+++ b/TRSDOS_GLOBAL/equates/equates-global-lowcore.s	2026-11-09 15:20:00
@@ -223,6 +223,10 @@
 	XDEF		dw_slot
 	XDEF		calc_dw_checksum
 	XDEF		drv_target_table
+	XDEF		sddvr_read_sector
+	XDEF		sddvr_write_sector
+	XDEF		sddvr_base_lba
+	XDEF		sddvr_init
 
 ; eZ80 associated xdef's.
 

--- a/TRSDOS_7/TRSDOS.s	2026-11-09 15:20:00
+++ b/TRSDOS_7/TRSDOS.s	2026-11-09 15:20:00
@@ -155,6 +155,9 @@
 		GOTO	zICNFG					; Here we start initilization chain.		
 		SUBTITLE	"< SYSRES HIGH memory region. >"
 		
